{
  "date": "2025-01-08",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모해",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 이제 퇴근~",
      "en": "I'm off work now~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "2일뒤면",
      "en": "In two days,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "방콕에 가있을텐데",
      "en": "I'll be in Bangkok."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "준비한것들 다 멋지게 보여줬으면",
      "en": "I hope I can show everything we've prepared in a cool way."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋겠구만",
      "en": "I really hope so."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 무슨머리하지",
      "en": "Ah, what should I do with my hair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "짘짜 모루겠음ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "I seriously have no idea ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생머리가 좋아?",
      "en": "Do you like straight hair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 무난해보이지 않아?",
      "en": "Doesn't it look a little too plain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "앞머리 기르는중이였는데",
      "en": "I was growing out my bangs,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다시 자를까 생각중",
      "en": "but I'm thinking about cutting them again."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "의견이 너무 반반이라",
      "en": "The opinions are split right down the middle."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 진짜 선택잘 못해",
      "en": "I'm really bad at making decisions."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그럼",
      "en": "Then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "방콕까지는 앞머리까고",
      "en": "Should I keep my bangs grown out until Bangkok,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미국투어 시작할땨 다시 잘라?",
      "en": "and cut them again when the U.S. tour starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 팔랑귀맞아…",
      "en": "I'm really easily persuaded..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그럼 방콕때",
      "en": "So for Bangkok..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "앞머리까고",
      "en": "Keep my bangs grown out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생머리???",
      "en": "and go with straight hair???"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가요대축제때 했잖아",
      "en": "I did that at the KBS Song Festival."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "앞머리까고 포니테일원해….",
      "en": "I want you to go with your bangs up and a ponytail..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "올빽",
      "en": "A slicked-back look..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해보고싶긴했는데",
      "en": "I've wanted to try it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아닌듯…",
      "en": "but I don't think so..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아아ㅏㅏㅏㅏ",
      "en": "Aaaahhhh."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정말!!",
      "en": "Seriously!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "소현언니머리?",
      "en": "Sohyun unnie's hairstyle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "매력있는 머리지…",
      "en": "It's definitely a charming hairstyle..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "소현머리 하면 이마 간지러워도 참아야 됨",
      "en": "If you do Sohyun's hairstyle, you'll have to endure it even if your forehead gets itchy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내생각앤",
      "en": "I think..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "까먹고 벅벅긁을듯",
      "en": "I'd probably forget and scratch it anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 이거뭐야",
      "en": "\"Ah, what's this?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면겈ㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "I'd be like that ㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그거 본드로 붙이는거임",
      "en": "It's attached with glue."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "본드로 붙히면 살도 떨어지는거 아니야??",
      "en": "If you glue it on, won't your skin come off too??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "벅벅 어 이마 떨어졋다",
      "en": "Scratch scratch—oh, my forehead fell off."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음 땀인가 오 피구나..!",
      "en": "Hmm, is that sweat? Oh... it's blood..!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그럼 생머리에",
      "en": "Then straight hair..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "앞머리 소현언니앞머리 아니면",
      "en": "With Sohyun unnie's bangs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반깐느낌?",
      "en": "Or maybe a half-up look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몰랑~",
      "en": "I don't know~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이쁘게 하고와볼개",
      "en": "I'll make sure to come looking pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "본무대에서 확인하실수 있습니다!",
      "en": "You can check it out on the main stage!"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아또",
      "en": "Oh, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반하능거 아닌가몰라",
      "en": "I wonder if you'll end up falling for me again."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촴나",
      "en": "Honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "까암짝 놀래라 그냥",
      "en": "You'll be totally shocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "으이",
      "en": "Sheesh."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이래놓고",
      "en": "But then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "위로 세갈래로 묶고나오면",
      "en": "what if I show up with my hair tied into three little sections sticking upward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정떨어짐?",
      "en": "Would you lose interest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "정은 안 떨어지는데 내 눈물이 떨어지겠지...",
      "en": "I wouldn't lose interest, but I'd probably start crying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "울지마 베이비",
      "en": "Don't cry, baby."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그래도 정하연이면 다섯갈래까지 감당해봄..",
      "en": "If it's Jeong Hayeon, I could even handle five sections..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이건 진짜 사랑이네",
      "en": "Now that's real love."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그 다섯갈랴가 춤출때마다 띠용띠용거림",
      "en": "Those five little sections would be bouncing around every time I dance."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "심지어 추다가 하나 풀려서 네갈래만 남음",
      "en": "One of them even comes loose while dancing, leaving only four."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래도 ㄱㅊ?",
      "en": "Would that still be okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하나 풀릴때마다 관객들 환호할듯",
      "en": "The audience would probably cheer every time one comes undone."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유후!!!! 하나더 !! 하나더!!!",
      "en": "Woohoo!!!! One more!! One more!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "웃기긴하겠네",
      "en": "That would actually be pretty funny."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 웃음 포기 또못하지",
      "en": "I just can't give up making people laugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그치만 넌 아이돌이잖아",
      "en": "But you're an idol."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치..",
      "en": "True..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마저..",
      "en": "You're right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "제가 좋아하는 아이돌이 개그우먼을 꿈꾸는 것 같아요 어떡하죠",
      "en": "I think my favorite idol dreams of becoming a comedian. What should I do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내공100인가요",
      "en": "Is this worth 100 knowledge points?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "S19 정하연의 새로운 꿈을 응원합니다…",
      "en": "I support S19 Jeong Hayeon's new dream..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헐",
      "en": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 이제 19살 19번 이라고 소개할거임",
      "en": "I'm going to introduce myself as '19-year-old No. 19' now."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "완전 올해만 할 수 있는 소개멘트네",
      "en": "That's an introduction you can only use this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "슬프다…",
      "en": "That's sad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘기억해줘…",
      "en": "Please remember it well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나중에는",
      "en": "Later on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하연이가 그렇게 소개할때도있었지…",
      "en": "People will say, 'Hayeon used to introduce herself like that...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이럴거아녀…",
      "en": "That's what's going to happen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "슬프다 ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "That's so sad ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "곧 군대라니 곧 군대라니 곧 군대라니..",
      "en": "Soon you'll be in the military... soon you'll be in the military..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나??",
      "en": "Me??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 곧 가시는군…",
      "en": "Oh... you're the one who's going soon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "대장인데 이미 군인인거 아냐?",
      "en": "You're already a soldier since you're the captain, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 어릴때꿈이",
      "en": "When I was little, my dream..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "군인이였어",
      "en": "was to become a soldier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "멋있어서",
      "en": "Because I thought it was cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "비슷하게 꿈을 이뤘네 육각대장이니까",
      "en": "You kind of achieved it since you're the Hexagon Captain."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말만이라도 이루어서 너무 좋다",
      "en": "I'm happy I got to achieve it, even if it's only in name."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "8명에서 더 돈독해진것같아",
      "en": "I think the eight of us have become even closer."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 멤버간의 끈끈함 이라기보다",
      "en": "Rather than just being close as members..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가족같은 느낌이야",
      "en": "it feels more like family."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사촌동생 언니들같은",
      "en": "Like cousins and older sisters..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "느낌",
      "en": "That's the kind of feeling."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "헐 서아랑 빈이 있어서 하연이는 거의 중간이네 나이",
      "en": "Wow, with Seoah and Binnie around, Hayeon is pretty much in the middle age-wise."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 주빈이와 서아의 챙김을 받는다는건",
      "en": "But being looked after by Joobin and Seoah means..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그럼 난….",
      "en": "Then I guess I'm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘도 주빈이가 입닦아주고",
      "en": "Even today, Joobin wiped my mouth for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주빈이는 사실",
      "en": "Honestly, Joobin is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니야",
      "en": "basically the unnie."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "추워하니까 서아가 패딩 덮어주고",
      "en": "When I was cold, Seoah covered me with a padded jacket."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 정말 사랑받는 언니야",
      "en": "I'm really a loved unnie."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 얼마나 카리스마 넘치는데",
      "en": "Do you know how charismatic I am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "물어봐봐",
      "en": "Go ask them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하연언니??? 진짜 도도하고 멋있는 언니에요!!!",
      "en": "\"Hayeon unnie??? She's such a chic and cool unnie!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이럴듯",
      "en": "That's probably what they'd say."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ"
    }
  ]
}
